{"tool_name":"hgv_lps","contents":["oeb","bioschemas","biotools"],"fetched_metadata":{"biotools":{"id":"hgv_lps","home":"https://github.com/galaxyproject/galaxy/tree/dev/tools","summary":"A tool for LASSO-Patternsearch algorithm. The LASSO-Patternsearch algorithm fits your dataset to an L1-regularized logistic regression model.","addition_date":"2016-12-19T14:30:21Z","last_update_date":"2024-11-25T13:56:41.435941Z","tool_type":["Web application"],"version":["1.0.0"],"collections":["Galaxy Tools","galaxyPasteur"],"accessibility":"Open access","biotools_curie":"biotools:hgv_lps","credit":[{"email":"galaxy@pasteur.fr","name":"Galaxy Support Team","typeEntity":"Person","typeRole":["Primary contact"]}],"documentation":[{"type":["General"],"url":"https://galaxy.pasteur.fr/root?tool_id=hgv_lps"}],"edit_permission":{"authors":["ELIXIR-EE"],"type":"group"},"function":[{"input":[{"data":{"term":"Data","uri":"http://edamontology.org/data_0006"},"format":[{"term":"TSV","uri":"http://edamontology.org/format_3475"}]}],"operation":[{"term":"Data handling","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_2409"},{"term":"Pathway or network prediction","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_3439"},{"term":"Regression analysis","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_3659"}],"output":[{"data":{"term":"Data","uri":"http://edamontology.org/data_0006"},"format":[{"term":"TSV","uri":"http://edamontology.org/format_3475"}]},{"data":{"term":"Data","uri":"http://edamontology.org/data_0006"},"format":[{"term":"Textual format","uri":"http://edamontology.org/format_2330"}]}]}],"maturity":"Mature","name":"hgv_lps","operating_system":["Linux","Mac","Windows"],"owner":"hmenager","publication":[{"doi":"10.1093/nar/gkw343","metadata":{"abstract":"High-throughput data production technologies, particularly \u2018next-generation\u2019 DNA sequencing, have ushered in widespread and disruptive changes to biomedical research. Making sense of the large datasets produced by these technologies requires sophisticated statistical and computational methods, as well as substantial computational power. This has led to an acute crisis in life sciences, as researchers without informatics training attempt to perform computation-dependent analyses. Since 2005, the Galaxy project has worked to address this problem by providing a framework that makes advanced computational tools usable by non experts. Galaxy seeks to make data-intensive research more accessible, transparent and reproducible by providing a Web-based environment in which users can perform computational analyses and have all of the details automatically tracked for later inspection, publication, or reuse. In this report we highlight recently added features enabling biomedical analyses on a large scale.","authors":[{"name":"Afgan E."},{"name":"Baker D."},{"name":"Blankenberg D."},{"name":"Bouvier D."},{"name":"Cech M."},{"name":"Chilton J."},{"name":"Clements D."},{"name":"Coraor N."},{"name":"Eberhard C."},{"name":"Goecks J."},{"name":"Gruning B."},{"name":"Guerler A."},{"name":"Hillman-Jackson J."},{"name":"Kuster G.V."},{"name":"Nekrutenko A."},{"name":"Rasche E."},{"name":"Soranzo N."},{"name":"Taylor J."},{"name":"Turaga N."},{"name":"van den Beek M."}],"citationCount":1410,"date":"2016-07-08T00:00:00Z","journal":"Nucleic Acids Research","title":"The Galaxy platform for accessible, reproducible and collaborative biomedical analyses: 2016 update"},"pmcid":"PMC4987906","pmid":"27137889","type":["Other"]},{"doi":"10.1186/1753-6561-1-s1-s60","pmcid":"PMC2367607","pmid":"18466561"},{"doi":"10.7490/f1000research.1114334.1","type":["Other"]}],"topic":[{"term":"Data mining","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_3473"},{"term":"Molecular interactions, pathways and networks","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_0602"},{"term":"Statistics and probability","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_2269"}],"validated":1},"bioschemas":{"name":"hgv_lps","home":"https://bio.tools/hgv_lps","version":"1.0.0","summary":"A tool for LASSO-Patt